WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:08.050
In Manage hosting, open Mailboxes, and click New mailbox.

2
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.755
Enter the mailbox name, and a strong password.

3
00:00:10.755 --> 00:00:21.250
Then click Create.

4
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.550
Next to the new mailbox, click Set up on device.

5
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:26.439
Pick your app.

6
00:00:26.439 --> 00:00:37.360
iPhone gets a one-tap profile, and Android and Outlook get the exact server settings.
